  nodes:
  - id: start
    npcText: "\u0130yi g\xFCnler hocam! G\xFCne\u015F Apartman\u0131 i\xE7in geldim.
      Be\u015F katl\u0131, k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir konut projesi."
    expression: 5
    choices:
    - text: "Ho\u015F geldiniz, belgeleri g\xF6relim."
      next: 
      evt: 3
    - text: "Balkonlar projeden b\xFCy\xFCk g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor?"
      next: balkon
      evt: 0
    next: 
    evt: 0
  - id: balkon
    npcText: "Ha, 15 santim fazla oldu, ev sahipleri \xF6yle istedi. Ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131
      sisteme dokunmad\u0131k, s\xF6z."
    expression: 0
    choices: []
    next: 
    evt: 3
